# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# .NET (solution lives in /dotnet)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/
TestResults/
coverage/
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/
